		"name": "Task Manager API",
		"description": "StartFragment\n\n## 📌 Overview\n\nThe **Task Manager API** is a backend service built using **Node.js, Express, and PostgreSQL**, designed to manage user accounts and personal tasks.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n- User registration\n    \n- Login with JWT authentication\n    \n- Create, read, update, and delete tasks\n    \n- Pagination and filtering\n    \n- Input validation\n    \n- Secure access control (each user sees only their own tasks)\n    \n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Tech Stack\n\n- **Node.js**\n    \n- **Express.js**\n    \n- **PostgreSQL** (pg)\n    \n- **JWT Authentication**\n    \n- **bcryptjs** for password hashing\n    \n- **Joi** for validation\n    \n- **Jest & Supertest** for testing\n    \n\n# 🏁 Final Notes\n\n- This API follows REST standards.\n    \n- All business logic validated with Joi.\n    \n- Secure authentication with JWT.\n    \n- Error handling implemented at global level.\n    \n- Pagination included for scalability.  \n      \n    \n\nEndFragment",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
